651 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 145 0 R
/T (Pythonhasa built-in safetylimit on the call-stack depth \(default 1000\) to prevent a stack overflow. Memoization removes the repeated work but not the depth: ways_memo\(n\) must still go n levels down before the first value is returned. In the run above, ways_memo\(500\) succeeded, while ways_memo\(1000\) and ways_memo\(3000\) raised RecursionError. \(On some interpreters or online compilers, n = 1000 lies exactly at the boundary and may or may not pass, depending on how many extra frames the platform uses; n = 3000 fails everywhere.\) )
/E (Pythonhasa built-in safetylimit on the call-stack depth \(default 1000\) to prevent a stack overflow. Memoization removes the repeated work but not the depth: ways_memo\(n\) must still go n levels down before the first value is returned. In the run above, ways_memo\(500\) succeeded, while ways_memo\(1000\) and ways_memo\(3000\) raised RecursionError. \(On some interpreters or online compilers, n = 1000 lies exactly at the boundary and may or may not pass, depending on how many extra frames the platform uses; n = 3000 fails everywhere.\) )
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [9]
>>
