/Title (2. The str.join\(\) method. join\(\) is significantly more efficient. It first calculates the total length required by scanning the list of parts, allocates a single block of memory of exactly the right size and copies all elements into it in one pass. This gives linear time complexity O\(n\), which is why it is the standard way to build large texts.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 2183 0 R
